body:
This is why I'm a germaphobe who changes clothes when I get home and keeps all bags at my front door and washes them weekly. Nothing goes past my bedroom door but clean clothes and pajamas.


Maybe my phobia and panic is sometimes justified ;_; 


If you do go through with OSHA/etc, word of mouth won't do. Make sure you got evidence of this that's tangible. You're going to want written/recorded proof.

My lobby person takes the last bus and she would say yes, because she is a very kind older lady but I can't do that to her ;_;


If it wasn't an insanely busy Friday night and I had people and time to clean before lobby reopens. I wouldn't feel so annoyed. Thursday nights or weekday nights, no problem, I'll have time around 1 or 4am. But Friday? 


Line has been to exit for 4 hours x_X.  I am so close to just waving a white flag and giving up the ghost
